novel:[["Serial novels","Dickens published many novels in monthly or weekly installments, which readers eagerly awaited."]],
impress:[["Post-Impressionists","Later artists such as Vincent van Gogh, Paul Cézanne and Paul Gauguin, called Post-Impressionists, built on the movement’s use of color and light."]],
